# Gates the registry has removed, and what covers them now.
#
# One basename per line. update_gates.sh deletes these from a repository that
# still carries them, and reports the hook lines that must go with them.
#
# A gate absent from templates/gates/ is ambiguous on its own: it may have been
# retired, or it may never have existed. This file is the difference, so a
# removal is a line in a diff rather than a silence.
#
# Retired at version 15 -- reimplemented what pre-commit already does, and are
# now hooks in .pre-commit-config.yaml:
check_compiles.py
no_local_paths.py
no_private_marker.py
check_voice.py
